{"d":"<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">Mūsdienīgs jumta segums. Galvenās materiāla īpatnības &ndash; spēja nodro&scaron;ināt simtprocentīgu jumta hermetizāciju, iespēja uzstādīt bez īpa&scaron;as tehnikas. Pla&scaron;a krāsu un piegriezumu daudzveidība. Piemērots jebkuras sarežģītības slīpo jumtu seguma ieklā&scaron;anai.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!--<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=TOP\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kolekcija TOP</span></span></a></h1>--->\r\n<div><!--<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Shinglas TOP&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">- Premium klases divslāņu laminēie bitumena dakstiņi ar uzlabotām īpa&scaron;ībām. TOP sastāv&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">no neaustā stiklaudekla pamatnes, kur&scaron; no abām pusēm ir pārklāts ar aukstas kvalitātes bitumenu.</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;Kā aizsargslānis tiek izmantots krāsains rupjgraudains bazalta pārklājums, kas aizsargā materiālu no saules staru iedarbības un pagarina kalpo&scaron;anas laiku. Pateicoties daudzslāņainai uzbūvei, Jazz piemīt&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">paaugstināta izturība un ilgmūžīgums, augstas hidroizolācijas īpa&scaron;ības un noturība pret vēju</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pla&scaron;ais pārklājuma krāsu salikums, padara materiālu estētiski izteiksmīgu, bet jumta klājuma reljefs&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">imitē jumta segumu no dabīgiem materiāliem.</span>&nbsp;Pateicoties minerālo granulu vienmērīgam krāsojumam<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;TOP</span>&nbsp;dakstiņu pārklājuma tonis ir ļoti noturīgs, kas nodro&scaron;ina lielisku jumta izskatu ilgu laiku.</span></p>--->\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=ULTRA\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\">Kolekcija ULTRA</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">SHINGLAS ULTRA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">&ndash; bitumena jumta dakstiņi, kas pieejami dažādās krāsās un formās.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Bitumena dakstiņi&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">SHINGLAS ULTRA&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">at&scaron;ķirībā no pārējiem bitumena dakstiņiem tiek izgatavots no polimēr-modificēta bitumena, kas uzlabo dakstiņu elastību un izturību.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pieejams pla&scaron;a bitumena dakstiņu krāsu un piegriezuma gamma.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 25 gadi.</span></span></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=CLASSIC\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kolekcija CLASSIC</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Pateicoties augststai kvalitātei un pieejamai cenai&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">SHINGLAS CLASSIC&nbsp;</span>bitumena dakstiņi ir iemantoju&scaron;i popularitāti Latvijas tirgū. Shinglas CLASSIC pla&scaron;ais formu un krāsu klāsts nodro&scaron;ina ikvienam būvētājm iespējas izvēlēties tie&scaron;i viņam vispiemērotāko dakstiņu toni un piegriezumu.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, geneva; font-size: small;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 15 gadi.</span></span></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0.5em 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; line-height: 40px; color: rgb(175, 32, 38); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; float: left; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 0px; font-size: 21px; outline: 0px !important;\"><a href=\"http://buvvide.lv/?l=1&amp;c=151&amp;p=0&amp;m=0&amp;filter=1&amp;pg=1&amp;ListT=tabula&amp;SortBy=Type&amp;SortDir=ASC&amp;prSk=40&amp;sh_Filter=oneselect&amp;sh_TypeG=&amp;sh_Type=0&amp;SPrice=0&amp;EPrice=0&amp;FilterA%5B1490349582%5D%5B%5D=STANDARD+ROCK\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\">Kolekcija STANDARD</span></span></a></h1>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0px 0px 0.5em; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Arial, Verdana; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-size: small;\">Bitumena dakstiņu&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\">STANDARD</span>&nbsp;ir lieliski piemēroti ēkām, kur galvenie priek&scaron;noteikumi jumta seguma izvēlē ir dro&scaron;ība, ekonomiskums un jumta izskats.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px !important; font-size: small;\">Ilgmūžības garantija 10 gadi.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><br><br>"}